msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:14
msgid "Store URL format"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:16
msgid "Stores are specified using a URL-like syntax. For example, the command"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix path-info --store https://cache.nixos.org/ --json \\\n"
"  /nix/store/1542dip9i7k4f24y6hqgd04hmvid9hr5-coreutils-9.1\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:23
msgid ""
"fetches information about a store path in the HTTP binary cache located at "
"https://cache.nixos.org/, which is a type of store."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:26
msgid ""
"Store URLs can specify **store settings** using URL query strings, i.e. by "
"appending `?name1=value1&name2=value2&...` to the URL. For instance,"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:30
msgid ""
"```\n"
"--store ssh://machine.example.org?ssh-key=/path/to/my/key\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:34
msgid ""
"tells Nix to access the store on a remote machine via the SSH protocol, "
"using `/path/to/my/key` as the SSH private key. The supported settings for "
"each store type are documented below."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:38
msgid "`auto` special URL"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:40
msgid ""
"The special store URL `auto` causes Nix to automatically select a store as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:43
msgid ""
"Use the [local store](./local-store.md) `/nix/store` if `/nix/var/nix` is "
"writable by the current user."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:46
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if `/nix/var/nix/daemon-socket/socket` exists, [connect to the "
"Nix daemon listening on that socket](./local-daemon-store.md)."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:49
msgid ""
"Otherwise, on Linux only, use the [local chroot store](../../store/types/"
"local-store.md#chroot) `~/.local/share/nix/root`, which will be created "
"automatically if it does not exist."
msgstr ""

#: source/store/types/index.md:53
msgid "Otherwise, use the [local store](./local-store.md) `/nix/store`."
msgstr ""
